s root cause rather than just masking symptoms.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4VL1LaYri_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg4VL1LaYri_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0Do6bThsX_text","label":"gg0Do6bThsX_text","default":"<p>Rachel Nguyen</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBxMQOVF0u_text","label":"ggBxMQOVF0u_text","default":"<p>BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguPXBSuiR8_text","label":"gguPXBSuiR8_text","default":"<p>Rachel leverages her extensive knowledge of bioactive plant compounds to optimize every component in MenoMate. \"Through rigorous clinical testing, we've ensured each ingredient delivers measurable improvements in tendon resilience and joint comfort—without resorting to synthetic compounds or short-term fixes.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdYQoR5hY__srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggdYQoR5hY__srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrQNJtt2wv_text","label":"ggrQNJtt2wv_text","default":"<p>Elizabeth Ross</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-QH35cJgW_text","label":"gg-QH35cJgW_text","default":"<p>OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUvlr3vOgd_text","label":"ggUvlr3vOgd_text","default":"<p>Dr. Ross applies decades of clinical experience to fine-tune MenoMate's synergistic blend. \"I've witnessed firsthand how critical natural tendon support becomes during hormonal transitions, especially for maintaining comfortable side-sleeping and daily mobility.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKeEFqfHqY_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggKeEFqfHqY_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRGYQVqWOR_text","label":"ggRGYQVqWOR_text","default":"<p>Kevin</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWaNGBtfJJ_text","label":"ggWaNGBtfJJ_text","default":"<p>Founder &amp; Biohacking Enthusiast</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggE2t-jp6P-_text","label":"ggE2t-jp6P-_text","default":"<p>Motivated by his wife's struggle with debilitating hip pain, Kevin committed to finding natural, research-backed alternatives. \"Watching my wife unable to sleep comfortably for months was heartbreaking. Creating MenoMate became my personal mission—helping women maintain their active lifestyles throughout menopause.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggduIgzsZ0i_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggduIgzsZ0i_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQQPrBunlO_text","label":"ggQQPrBunlO_text","default":"<p>Dr. Claire Thompson</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1omxLChOb_text","label":"gg1omxLChOb_text","default":"<p>ND- Women's Hormone Expert</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrZpeVzyFI_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggrZpeVzyFI_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrmJlXdC1F_text","label":"ggrmJlXdC1F_text","default":"Rachel Nguyen"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGxeJisgy5_text","label":"ggGxeJisgy5_text","default":"BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBRDKkOdid_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggBRDKkOdid_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpVHDeeO9d_text","label":"ggpVHDeeO9d_text","default":"Elizabeth Ross"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0qq8rvr8I_text","label":"gg0qq8rvr8I_text","default":"OB/GYN - 25+ Years in Women's Health"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoZ6uQZKgp_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggoZ6uQZKgp_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2nOY7Foy4_text","label":"gg2nOY7Foy4_text","default":"<p>Kevin</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGuRZs59DR_text","label":"ggGuRZs59DR_text","default":"Founder & Biohacking Enthusiast"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVV7uRGN0v_srcSet_desktop_